### Requires the "REST Client" VS Code extension (humao.rest-client)
### Click "Send Request" above any block below. Server must be running on port 4477.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4477

### Mind state (mood, curiosity, confidence, focus, digest)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mind

### Full memory (all blocks: chat / net / self)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/memory

### Recent autonomous reasoning notes (markdown, up to 50)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reasoning

### Force an autonomous reasoning tick right now
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reasoning/trigger

### When the next scheduled reasoning tick will fire
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reasoning/next

### Force a self-questioning tick right now
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/self/trigger

### When the next scheduled self-questioning tick will fire
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/self/next

### Force a net-feed ingest (Wikipedia / Hacker News) right now
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/feed/trigger

### Recently ingested net items
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feed/recent

### When the next scheduled feed ingest will fire
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feed/next

### Lexicon stats (words learned from a real dictionary)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/lexicon/stats

### Force a lexicon learning tick right now
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/lexicon/trigger

### Look up a specific learned word
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/lexicon/word/consciousness

### Chat with it directly
# @name chat
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "What have you learned about drawing so far?"
}

### Check access passcode
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/access/check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passcode": "0000"
}

### Change access passcode
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/access/change
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "current": "0000",
#   "next": "newpass"
# }
